{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/lem-topological-mass-holonomy","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Lemma","doco:Section"],"label":"lem:topological-mass-holonomy","kind":"lemma","title":"Descended term is the unknot-core holonomy","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/lem-topological-mass-eigenspace-decomp"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-topological-mass-holonomy"],"cites":["references/yekutieli2015"],"tags":["holonomy","ascent-embedding","blow-up","nonabelian-stokes"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.LiftingDescent.tm_descended_is_holonomy","text":"topological-mass-holonomy.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"lem:topological-mass-holonomy\"></a><p><em>Consider the topological blow-up decomposition <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Sigma = \\Sigma_0 \\cup \\bigcup_{i=1}^N D_i</code>, where <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Sigma_0</code> forms a disc spanning the unknot core <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\varrho_0</code> and each <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">D_i</code> forms the exceptional disc at the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">i</code>-th blow-up. Under this decomposition, the descended term equals the unknot-core holonomy:</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\mathrm{MI}\\!\\!\\int_\\Sigma \\hat{\\tau}_n(\\alpha)\n  =\n  \\mathrm{Hol}_{\\nabla_A}\\!\\bigl(\\varrho_0; \\mathfrak{G}\\bigr).</code></pre>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/topological-mass-holonomy.md","heading":"Lemma","number":"11.1.21","page":"b/lem-topological-mass-holonomy","qa":{"counts":{"pass":93,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":19,"unknown":0,"stale":86},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.LiftingDescent.tm_descended_is_holonomy","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/tm_descended_is_holonomy.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
